    ✌️🐇🧰 target 🔤?🔤❗️ ➡️ pieces
    🧹🐇🧰 🐽 pieces 0❗️❗️ ➡️ 🖍path
    ↪️ 📏 pieces❓ ▶️ 1 🍇
      🔂 pair 🔫 🐽 pieces 1❗️ 🔤&🔤❗️ 🍇
