  📗
    Parses the head of a request (request line + headers, without the blank
    line). Returns no value if the request line is malformed.
  📗
  🐇❗️ 📖 head 🔡 ➡️ 🍬📨 🍇
    🔫 head 🔤❌r❌n🔤❗️ ➡️ lines
    🔫 🐽 lines 0❗️ 🔤 🔤❗️ ➡️ first
    ↪️ 📏 first❓ ◀️ 3 🍇
      ↩️ 🤷‍♀️
    🍉
    ↪️ ❎ 🎼 🐽 first 2❗️ 🔤HTTP/🔤❗️❗️ 🍇
      ↩️ 🤷‍♀️
    🍉
    🆕📨 🐽 first 0❗️ 🐽 first 1❗️❗️ ➡️ request
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 1 📏 lines❓❗️ 🍇
      ✌️🐇🧰 🐽 lines i❗️ 🔤:🔤❗️ ➡️ header
      ↪️ 📏 header❓ 🙌 2 🍇
        🔖 request 🧽🐇🧰 🐽 header 0❗️❗️ 🧽🐇🧰 🐽 header 1❗️❗️❗️
      🍉
